@startuml sequence-uc09
title 图 2-11 UC-09 开具处方（草稿） · 顺序图

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 11
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

actor 医生 as D
participant "PrescriptionEditPage" as UI
participant "PrescriptionController" as CTRL
participant "PrescriptionDraftService" as SVC
participant "ConsultationOrderRepository" as ORDER_REPO
participant "DrugQueryPort" as DRUG
participant "Prescription" as PRE
participant "PrescriptionRepository" as PRE_REPO
database "MySQL" as DB

D -> UI : 在问诊中订单点击「开具处方」
UI -> CTRL : POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/prescriptions
CTRL -> SVC : createOrGetDraft(orderId, currentDoctorId)
SVC -> ORDER_REPO : findByIdAndDoctorId(orderId, doctorId)
ORDER_REPO --> SVC : ORDER
alt 订单不属于当前医生或状态不是「问诊中」
  SVC --> CTRL : 404 / 409
  CTRL --> UI : 错误响应
else 已有 DRAFT
  SVC --> CTRL : 返回已有处方
else 新建草稿
  SVC -> PRE : createDraft(orderId, doctorId, patientId)
  SVC -> PRE_REPO : save(prescription)
  PRE_REPO -> DB : INSERT prescription(status='DRAFT')
  SVC --> CTRL : PrescriptionVO
end

D -> UI : 检索药品、填写诊断与 1~5 条明细
UI -> CTRL : PUT /api/v1/prescriptions/{id}/draft
CTRL -> SVC : saveDraft(prescriptionId, diagnosis, items, version)
SVC -> PRE_REPO : findByIdAndDoctorId(prescriptionId, doctorId)
SVC -> DRUG : findEnabledByIds(drugIds)
DRUG --> SVC : 药品列表（启用）
alt 诊断为空 / 明细为空或超过 5 条 / 药品已停用
  SVC --> CTRL : 400 PARAM_INVALID
else 校验通过
  SVC -> PRE : updateDraft(diagnosis, items)
  SVC -> PRE_REPO : saveWithItems(prescription, items, version)
  PRE_REPO -> DB : UPDATE prescription ...；INSERT/UPDATE prescription_item ...
  SVC --> CTRL : PrescriptionVO
  CTRL --> UI : 200 { data }
end

note right of SVC
  明细的 drugNameSnapshot / unitPriceSnapshot
  在保存时从药品目录复制，作为历史快照；
  草稿保存使用 version 做乐观锁。
end note
@enduml
